e; the artists painted the cycle rather than designing the entire church.","sourcePhoto":"IMG_3609.jpeg","selection":"User-selected ARCHED study map; frequency not independently established","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brancacci_Chapel","photoReferences":[],"lat":43.7677222,"lon":11.243575,"verification":"Reference retrieved; phase-aware summary","coordinateSource":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brancacci_Chapel","officialUrl":"https://www.feelflorence.it/it/punti-di-interesse/cappella-brancacci","placeType":"Chapel","verifiedOn":"2026-10-03","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Izokefalizm.jpg/960px-Izokefalizm.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","file":"Izokefalizm.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Izokefalizm.jpg","credit":"Masaccio","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","src":"/.netlify/functions/access?action=media&name=2628bc895daa37be238ccaca.webp","width":960,"height":475,"caption":"Chapel fresco"}},{"id":"CH54-041","title":"Santa Maria delle Carceri","canonicalTitle":"Santa Maria delle Carceri","city":"Prato","kind":"church","era":"renaissance","style":"Renaissance","built":"Interior 1486–1495; exterior work continued later","architect":"Giuliano da Sangallo","studyNote":"Greek-cross central plan; commissioned with support from Lorenzo de' Medici.","sourcePhoto":"IMG_3609.jpeg","selection":"User-selected ARCHED study map; frequency not independently established","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Maria_delle_Carceri,_Prato","photoReferences":[],"lat":43.8794361,"lon":11.09845,"verification":"Reference retrieved; phase-aware summary","coordinateSource":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Maria_delle_Carceri,_Prato","officialUrl":"https://www.cittadiprato.it/EN/Sezioni/186/Santa-Maria-delle-Carceri-/","placeType":"Church","verifiedOn":"2026-10-03","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Santa_maria_